    "this file says which of them are the board's DEFAULTS (bus instance order,",
    "PWM/DAC/1-Wire capability, board-specific aliases).",
    "",
    "Everything here is filtered against the real shell by",
    "scripts/gen-autowiring-pins.mjs — a pin listed below that the board does",
    "not expose is dropped automatically, so this file can never make the",
    "engine assign a pin the board lacks.",
    "",
    "Family keys must match the rules in gen-autowiring-pins.mjs."
